  "qualification_limits": [
    "All tested real Blender thumbnails were 128×128; other dimensions have authored carrier coverage only.",
    "Real Blender file headers qualified: 2.52, 2.62, 2.78, 2.80, 4.4, 5.1 and 5.2. Files named BlenderDefault_250 actually contain 2.52 headers. Other releases using the same grammar still need representative qualification.",
    "Accepted real Blender files are 64-bit little-endian. The 32-bit little-endian grammar has authored tests only; the actual 32-bit 2.48 source predates the qualified thumbnail carrier and errors. Big-endian remains explicitly unsupported.",
    "Blender 2.52 files both with and without TEST were observed. Saved-thumbnail absence returns None; Blender geometry regeneration is not implemented.",
    "Real DWGs qualified: R13, R14, 2000, 2004, 2007, 2010, 2013 and 2018. Five generations also have six additional line/sample files. The actual 2018 Line.dwg has a valid preview section containing only type 1 metadata and correctly returns None. Other producers, service packs and future revisions remain unqualified.",
    "DWG DIB and PNG carriers are proven. WMF needs a separate vector-metafile renderer and errors when no qualified raster is present. Preview encryption rejection is covered synthetically, without a real encrypted DWG sample.",
    "The reader validates declared addresses, exact section sentinels, table bounds and independent carrier sizes. It does not validate whole DWG geometry, header CRC or section maps. Authored fixtures contain thumbnail carriers without complete DWG geometry.",
    "External DWG and Blender Export 3DM repository program licenses do not separately establish asset redistribution permission. Their source files and proof PNGs remain under /tmp and are not published in the repository or Pages.",
    "Extraction does not call Blender, AutoCAD or LibreDWG executables. Geometry regeneration is not implemented. Thumbnail freshness is whatever the source application last saved."
  ],
  "checks": {
    "unit_and_fixture_tests": 8,
    "focus_command": "CARGO_HOME=/tmp/catwalk-cargo cargo test --offline --locked --lib saved_preview::blend_dwg",
    "independent_pixel_checks": "Python Pillow independently compared raw TEST bottom-up RGBA after vertical flip for four raw Blender files, original typed PNG payloads for DWG 2013/2018, and independently reconstructed BMP headers for ten actual palette-DIB previews. All decoded pixels matched exactly."
  },
